# Library & Bookstore Management System

A simple console-based management system written in C++ to practice object-oriented programming, modern memory management, and STL containers.

## Features
- **Polymorphic Inventory:** Uses abstract base classes (`MediaItem`) and smart pointers (`std::shared_ptr`) to manage items dynamically.
- **User Roles:** Structured classes for library patrons and retail customers.
- **Core Operations:** Add new books, display current inventory, and search items instantly by ISBN.

## Tech Stack
- Language: C++ (Standard: C++11 or later)
- Environment: Visual Studio Code

